  "termsAndConditionsIntro": "By using the Campresso application, you agree to the following terms and conditions:",

  "policy1Title": "Data Collection",
  "policy1Body": "We collect only the necessary information required to operate and improve our services, such as account details, preferences, and usage patterns. No unnecessary personal data will be collected.",

  "policy2Title": "Use of Information",
  "policy2Body": "Collected data is used solely to enhance user experience, personalize services, and ensure smooth functionality of the app. Your information will not be sold or shared with third parties without your explicit consent, unless required by law.",

