  "policy3Body": "Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their account credentials and ensuring accurate information is provided during registration.",

  "policy4Title": "Security Measures",
  "policy4Body": "We implement industry-standard security practices to protect stored data from unauthorized access, misuse, or alteration.",

  "policy5Title": "Third-Party Services",
  "policy5Body": "If the app integrates third-party tools or payment gateways, their respective privacy and security policies apply as well.",

  "policy6Title": "Right to Access and Delete Data",
  "policy6Body": "Users may request to view, update, or delete their personal data at any time through the app’s support channel.",

  "policy7Title": "Acceptance of Policy",
  "policy7Body": "By continuing to use the app, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to this Privacy Policy and Terms & Conditions.",

