  "helpQ1": "How do I create an account?",
  "helpA1": "Go to the Registration page, fill in the required details, and submit the form.",

  "helpQ2": "How can I reset my password?",
  "helpA2": "Use the “Forgot Password” option on the Login page to receive a reset link.",

  "helpQ3": "Where can I view my orders?",
  "helpA3": "Open your Profile → “My Orders” section to view your current and previous orders.",

  "helpQ4": "How do I contact support?",
  "helpA4": "Go to Profile → Support and send us your message. We’ll respond as soon as possible.",

  "helpQ5": "How do I cancel an order?",
  "helpA5": "You can cancel an order if it hasn’t started preparing yet. Go to Orders → select the order → Cancel.",

  "helpQ6": "Can I change the pickup time?",
  "helpA6": "Yes. Before the order is prepared, you can update the scheduled pickup time from the order details.",

  "helpQ7": "What payment methods are supported?",
  "helpA7": "We support Cash on Delivery and Online Payment (Apple Pay / Google Pay) depending on your device.",

  "helpQ8": "How do I earn reward points?",
  "helpA8": "Show your QR code in the cafe when you pick up your order to earn reward points.",

  "helpQ9": "Why can’t I see my order?",
  "helpA9": "Check your internet connection and refresh the Orders page. If the issue continues, contact support.",

  "helpQ10": "How do I change the app language?",
  "helpA10": "Change the language from your device settings, then reopen the app.",

